# Trivy vulnerability exceptions
# Each entry requires an expiry date and justification in the form
#   # Expires: YYYY-MM-DD — <why>
# followed by the advisory id on its own line. CI (security.yml, "Trivy – expired
# exceptions") fails once an expiry date has passed, so every exception gets re-reviewed.
#
# (GHSA-36hh-v3qg-5jq4 / pyo3 in temporalio was removed 2026-09-05: temporalio 1.32.0
#  ships pyo3 0.29.0, which contains the fix.)
